{"ticker":"ACN","updated":"2026-10-23T22:33:24Z","profile":{"longName":"Accenture plc","shortName":"Accenture plc","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","country":"Ireland","website":"https://www.accenture.com","fullTimeEmployees":814000,"marketCap":152599986176,"trailingPE":18.390118,"forwardPE":15.697084,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.0570626,"pegRatio":2.28,"targetMeanPrice":227.07124,"targetHighPrice":280.0,"targetLowPrice":163.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.062,"earningsGrowth":0.464,"grossMargins":0.3205,"operatingMargins":0.17828,"profitMargins":0.11279,"totalRevenue":74183442432,"beta":1.102,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":291.09,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":118.15,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.64},"summary":"Accenture plc provides consulting and managed services in the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia Pacific. It offers artificial intelligence and data; cloud consulting; cybersecurity consulting; digital engineering and manufacturing; ecosystem partners; emerging technology; finance and risk management consulting; infrastructure and capital projects; digital learning; supply chain consulting; technology consulting; sustainability consulting; and metaverse solutions, as well as customer services. The company also provides proprietary assets and platforms, such as GenWizard, SynOps and reinvention.AI to clients. It serves aerospace and defense, automotive, banking, capital markets, chemicals, communications and media, consumer goods and services, energy, health, high tech, industrial, insurance, life sciences, natural resources, private equity, public service, retail, software and platforms, travel, and utilities industries. Accenture plc was founded in 1951 and is based in Dublin, Ireland.","summary_zh":"埃森哲公司在美洲、歐洲、中東、非洲和亞太地區提供顧問和管理服務。它提供人工智慧和數據；雲端諮詢；網路安全諮詢；數位工程和製造；生態系統合作夥伴；新興技術；財務和風險管理諮詢；基礎設施和資本項目；數位化學習；供應鏈諮詢；技術諮詢；永續發展諮詢；和元宇宙解決方案以及客戶服務。該公司還向